{% doc %}
  Grid or list view for a page of product cards, with no JavaScript: two radio chips (the same
  .chip pattern as the variant picker) and a few CSS rules that react to the checked one with
  :has() on the wrapper. Render it inside <div class="view-wrap">, BEFORE <facets-form>: facets.js
  replaces everything inside facets-form on every filter change, so a toggle inside it would reset to
  the grid each time.

  The choice is remembered: snippets/theme-init.liquid saves it (localStorage singi-view), puts a saved
  "list" on <html> as data-view before first paint (so there is no flash of the grid) and keeps these radios
  in step. Without JavaScript the radios still work, but nothing is remembered and the grid is the default.
  Decision record: docs/decisions/010-grid-and-list-view-without-javascript.md.

  The toggle sits on the filter bar's line, at its end: the bar leaves room for it (padding-inline-end on
  .facets) and the toggle is placed over that room. All of it is logical properties, so it mirrors in right to left.

  In the list view the card's image is a fixed 7.5rem column and the text sits beside it. The card's
  absolutely placed parts (AI label, favorite heart) are positioned against the image's corner, not the card's. The sold out badge moves into the text column, above the title, because the narrow image has no room for it beside the heart. The quick add button (when on) keeps the image's bottom start corner, and a card's video preview (when on) is as wide as the image. The text is centered beside the image with two spacer rows.

  @example
  <div class="view-wrap">
    {% render 'view-toggle' %}
    <facets-form>...</facets-form>
  </div>
{% enddoc %}

<fieldset class="view-toggle">
  <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ 'collection.view' | t }}</legend>
  <input class="chip-input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="view" id="view-grid" value="grid" checked>
  <label class="chip view-option" for="view-grid">
    {%- render 'icon', name: 'grid' -%}
    <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'collection.view_grid' | t }}</span></label
  >
  <input class="chip-input visually-hidden" type="radio" name="view" id="view-list" value="list">
  <label class="chip view-option" for="view-list">
    {%- render 'icon', name: 'list' -%}
    <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'collection.view_list' | t }}</span></label
  >
</fieldset>

{% stylesheet %}
  .view-wrap { position: relative; }
  .view-wrap:has(.view-toggle) .facets { padding-inline-end: 6.5rem; }
  .view-toggle { position: absolute; inset-block-start: 0.125rem; inset-inline-end: 0; display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .view-option { min-width: 2.75rem; justify-content: center; padding-inline: 0.75rem; }
  .view-option .icon { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 48rem; gap: 1.25rem 0; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card { grid-template-columns: 7.5rem 1fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr repeat(3, auto) 1fr; gap: 0 1rem; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card > :is(img, .product-card__media) { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / -1; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card > :is(.product-card__type, .product-card__title, .price) { grid-column: 2; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card__type { grid-row: 2; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card__title { grid-row: 3; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card > .price { grid-row: 4; margin-block-start: 0.25rem; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card__badge { position: static; grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; align-self: end; justify-self: start; margin-block-end: 0.5rem; }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .product-card > .ai-label { inset-block: calc(7.5rem * var(--ratio-h) - 0.75rem) auto; inset-inline: auto calc(100% - 7.5rem + 0.75rem); }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .wishlist-heart { inset-inline-end: calc(100% - 7.5rem); }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .card-add { inset-block-start: calc(7.5rem * var(--ratio-h) - 0.75rem); }
  :is(.view-wrap:has(#view-list:checked), :root[data-view='list'] .view-wrap) .card-video { width: 7.5rem; }
{% endstylesheet %}
